  "talkHoaOwlL1": "They say owls are night birds. Yet here I am at your door by five every morning.",
  "talkHoaOwlL2": "But Mr. Hoa, we open at seven!",
  "talkHoaOwlL3": "I know. Those two hours are for smelling the butter through the door.",
  "talkHoaOwlC1": "I'll open early for you, then!",
  "talkHoaOwlR1": "No, no. Waiting is half the flavour of an egg tart.",
  "talkHoaOwlC2": "Then I'll bake so well you can smell it from home!",
  "talkHoaOwlR2": "Then I'd lose my excuse to wake up early. Very well, deal.",
  "talkHoaOwlL4": "Then tomorrow, the first tart out of the oven is yours.",

  "talkLinhSketchL1": "Mai, hold still! I'm sketching you.",
  "talkLinhSketchL2": "But I've got flour all over my hair…",
  "talkLinhSketchL3": "Done! Take a look.",
  "talkLinhSketchL4": "Linh… why am I a steamed bun wearing an apron?",
  "talkLinhSketchL5": "Because you're round, soft and warm. It's a compliment!",
  "talkLinhSketchC1": "Then give me a bow!",
  "talkLinhSketchR1": "Two bows! The cutest bun in town!",
  "talkLinhSketchC2": "Can I hang it by the counter?",
  "talkLinhSketchR2": "Really? Look, my ears just shot straight up!",

  "talkKenjiCloudL1": "Today I feel like a cloud that meant to rain… then changed its mind.",
  "talkKenjiCloudL2": "A cloud that changed its mind… Let me think.",
  "talkKenjiCloudC1": "Matcha cake: a little bitter at first, then sweeter.",
  "talkKenjiCloudR1": "That's exactly the cloud. I'll photograph it before I eat.",
  "talkKenjiCloudC2": "A vanilla cupcake, white and fluffy like a cloud.",
  "talkKenjiCloudR2": "A bit… literal. But I like your honesty.",
  "talkKenjiCloudL3": "Every visit here, my film roll gets a little shorter.",

  "talkRosaSecretL1": "Do you know, dear, for sixty years I have eaten cake only with a silver fork.",
  "talkRosaSecretL2": "Yes… but there's a dab of cream on the tip of your nose.",
  "talkRosaSecretL3": "Hmm. The wind must have blown it there.",
  "talkRosaSecretL4": "There's no wind indoors, though?",
  "talkRosaSecretC1": "(Wink) I didn't see a thing.",
  "talkRosaSecretR1": "Clever girl. Here's a tip for your discretion.",
  "talkRosaSecretC2": "Go on, have a taste, today's cream is lovely!",
  "talkRosaSecretR2": "(A very quick lick) …It is lovely. Tell no one.",

  "talkMochiBellyL1": "Mrrp.",
  "talkMochiBellyL2": "Soaked again? The oven's still warm, go dry off.",
  "talkMochiBellyL3": "(Mochi flops over and shows a fluffy belly.)",
  "talkMochiBellyL4": "It's a trap. I know it. Belly rubs mean bites.",
  "talkMochiBellyC1": "Rub the belly",
  "talkMochiBellyR1": "(Mochi hugs Mai's hand with all four paws… and purrs.)",
  "talkMochiBellyC2": "Roll the yarn ball",
  "talkMochiBellyR2": "(Mochi chases the yarn and skids a full circle across the floor.)",
  "talkMochiBellyL5": "You little rascal.",

  "talkWalrusFishL1": "Guess how big the fish I caught this morning was?",
  "talkWalrusFishL2": "How big?",
  "talkWalrusFishL3": "As big as… your oven!",
  "talkWalrusFishC1": "Last week you said it was as big as the fridge.",
  "talkWalrusFishR1": "Well… it's been growing! Even the fish eat your pastries.",
  "talkWalrusFishC2": "Did you bring it home?",
  "talkWalrusFishR2": "It begged to be let go. Promised to come back tomorrow… even bigger.",
  "talkWalrusFishL4": "Then I'd better get a bigger oven ready.",

  "talkSquirrelNutL1": "Can I pay in chestnuts? I've got a whole stash!",
  "talkSquirrelNutL2": "Oh… we only take coins here.",
  "talkSquirrelNutL3": "Wait, let me check my tail…",
  "talkSquirrelNutL4": "Here! Three coins, a button, and… one emergency chestnut.",
  "talkSquirrelNutC1": "I'll take the coins, you keep the chestnut.",
  "talkSquirrelNutR1": "You're the best! I'll bury it outside so a tree grows for you.",
  "talkSquirrelNutC2": "Give me the chestnut, I'll bake you something with it!",
  "talkSquirrelNutR2": "Really? I'll fetch more… from wherever I buried them. I forgot where.",

  "talkHamsterCheeksL1": "Could I have… mmf-mm-mmf…",
  "talkHamsterCheeksL2": "Sweetie, your cheeks are already full of cookies.",
  "talkHamsterCheeksL3": "(Gulp) Those are for later. This one is for now!",
  "talkHamsterCheeksC1": "Let me box some up for you to take home.",
  "talkHamsterCheeksR1": "A box! My cheeks get the day off!",
  "talkHamsterCheeksC2": "Think you can fit one more?",
  "talkHamsterCheeksR2": "Challenge accepted! …Mmf… perfect fit.",

  "smallTalkNora": "Your usual today? I remember!",
  "smallTalkBao": "…Fresh out of the oven. Still warm.",
  "smallTalkTheo": "Today's tea is brewed with a smile, give it a try!",
  "smallTalkMai1": "Lovely day! Been down to the beach yet?",
  "smallTalkMai2": "The next batch has a pinch of cinnamon, come back and try it!",
  "smallTalkReply1": "Aw, thank you!",
  "smallTalkReply2": "Lovely, I'll be back tomorrow!",
  "smallTalkReply3": "This place always smells so good.",

  "quarrelLastCakeL1": "This strawberry cupcake is mine! I saw it first!",
  "quarrelLastCakeL2": "But I've been dreaming about it since yesterday!",
  "quarrelLastCakeL3": "Dreaming doesn't count!",
  "quarrelLastCakeL4": "Easy, you two, the cupcake's getting squished!",
  "quarrelLastCakeA": "Split it in half",
  "quarrelLastCakeRA1": "Half… fits perfectly in one cheek!",
  "quarrelLastCakeRA2": "My half has more frosting. Hehe.",
  "quarrelLastCakeB": "Rock-paper-scissors for it",
  "quarrelLastCakeRB1": "Rock, paper, scissors… shoot!",
  "quarrelLastCakeRB2": "I win!",
  "quarrelLastCakeRB3": "Hmph… next time I'm going rock.",
  "quarrelLastCakeC": "A fresh batch is almost out, one each!",
  "quarrelLastCakeRC1": "One EACH?!",
  "quarrelLastCakeRC2": "You're a pastry angel!",

  "quarrelFirstL1": "I've been here since sunrise! I go first!",
  "quarrelFirstL2": "I napped on this doorstep all night. That's what cats do.",
  "quarrelFirstL3": "Napping isn't queueing!",
  "quarrelFirstL4": "For cats, it is.",
  "quarrelFirstL5": "Okay, okay, deep breaths!",
  "quarrelFirstA": "Come in together, the door's wide enough!",
  "quarrelFirstRA1": "…It's a bit tight.",
  "quarrelFirstRA2": "Suck in your tummy.",
  "quarrelFirstRA3": "(They're stuck in the doorway for a second… then both burst out laughing.)",
  "quarrelFirstB": "Check the paw prints on the doormat",
  "quarrelFirstRB1": "Cat prints underneath… shiba prints on top.",
  "quarrelFirstRB2": "Well… I did stand on their paw prints.",
  "quarrelFirstRB3": "Thank you. You're adorable. After me.",
  "quarrelFirstC": "Best joke goes first",
  "quarrelFirstRC1": "Why did the croissant see a doctor? It was feeling flaky!",
  "quarrelFirstRC2": "…That was awful. I laughed. You go first.",

  "quarrelTartL1": "Egg tarts are the king of pastries! Crisp, rich, golden as the sun!",
  "quarrelTartL2": "King? I'm the king around here. And the king picks apple pie.",
  "quarrelTartL3": "All you've got is a big mane!",
  "quarrelTartL4": "And all you've got is a round belly!",
  "quarrelTartL5": "Gentlemen, the whole street is watching!",
  "quarrelTartA": "Blind taste test, try both!",
  "quarrelTartRA1": "This one's… better. It's the apple pie?!",
  "quarrelTartRA2": "And I picked… the egg tart. Oh no.",
  "quarrelTartRA3": "Fine, we'll buy both!",
  "quarrelTartB": "Every pastry is delicious, shake hands!",
  "quarrelTartRB1": "Spoken like a diplomat.",
  "quarrelTartRB2": "Bland as unseasoned dough.",
  "quarrelTartC": "Ask Mr. Hoa to settle it",
  "quarrelTartCAlt": "Do your best Mr. Hoa impression",
  "quarrelTartRC1": "Egg tart. Forty years. Not up for debate.",
  "quarrelTartRC1Alt": "(Deep voice) Ahem… Egg tart. Forty years. Not up for debate.",
  "quarrelTartRC2": "Hear that? Hear that!",
  "quarrelTartRC3": "Hmph. The seniors' club is biased.",

